          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobalas ikewadikak lukijesunos koYerusalem ebe, “Ejai Beelesebul, ido ireŋeari ajokin kanuka ekapolon loka ajokin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
