              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kopotu do totoke ka ikeinacan; kobwaata kokiŋa, kiyakikis akirot anyaraunia ŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiboie ekodet elukunit ŋes; kobalas ŋes ebe, “Koany, totokon ka ikoniinacan ejaas kiŋa, kimootos jo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koboŋok kes kotema atiar, “Iŋai bo totoka ka ikainacan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirere ŋul lueboiete elukunito ŋes, kotema atiar, “Koany, totoka, ka ikainacan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai ituŋanan kere yeniswamai nuekoto Edeke, ŋin ŋes onaceka, ka inacika, ka totoka da.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.35",
